            "show_subtext": true,
            "subtext": "<strong>Marketing Materials</strong> defines how your brand is built and used in the real world. This includes <strong>core logos, secondary marks, patterns, typography, and layout rules</strong>—based on an approved visual direction. We determine how the logo functions at different sizes, where and when marks are used, and how headlines and body copy work together.",
