            "eyebrow": "The Deliverables",
            "eyebrow_size": 12,
            "eyebrow_color": "#14213d",
            "heading": "What We Actually Build",
            "heading_size": 48,
            "heading_color": "#14213d",
            "subheading": "<p>Exploring the intersection of elegance and innovation</p>",
            "subheading_size": 18,
            "subheading_color": "#242833",
            "header_spacing": 40,
            "body_text": "<p>Marketing materials are developed as part of a larger brand system, not as isolated pieces. Each asset is designed for consistency, longevity, and use in high-value environments.</p><p><strong>Marketing materials may include:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Site & Yard Signage</strong><br/>Designed with scale, hierarchy, materials, and viewing distance in mind—supporting developments without diluting brand perception.</li><li><strong>Business Cards & Stationery</strong><br/>Precisely specified layouts and finishes that reflect brand positioning at an executive level.</li><li><strong>Leasing & Sales Collateral</strong><br/>Structured decks and presentation materials built for clarity, storytelling, and repeat use.</li><li><strong>Cut Sheets & Specification Documents</strong><br/>Clean, technical documents that communicate information efficiently to partners and vendors.</li><li><strong>Interactive PDFs & Digital Materials</strong><br/>Screen-optimized assets designed for distribution, updates, and long-term use.</li><li><strong>Tenant & Partner Kits</strong><br/>Cohesive materials that establish alignment, standards, and expectations from the start.</li></ul><p>All materials are designed to feel intentional, refined, and aligned with the environments they represent.</p>",
            "body_text_size": 16,
            "body_text_color": "#242833",
            "text_spacing": 30,
            "show_image_1": true,
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/New_Era_Design_Services_Website_Assets_Recovered.jpg",
